        "type": "reg",
        "input": "2\n5\n10010\n6\n010010",
        "output": "2\n4",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nTest case 1:\nFollowing substrings are good :\n\n10010\n10010\n\nTest case 2:\nFollowing substrings are good :\n\n010010\n010010\n010010\n010010"
      }
    ]
  },
